Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked. Now we run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking at the next\Ninternational champ, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My iron cage sends any monster\NI choose to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes Yu-Gi's only monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster I choose to crush is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My Iron Hans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.85,0:01:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He just destroyed his own monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When my Iron Hans goes to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.59,0:01:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the true power of my\NIron Knight is released.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a thousand extra points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, Yugi's monster is toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Iron Knight attack his\Nobnoxious Celtic guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's little fortress is the perfect\Nplace for a joust, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Forest Hunter, attack\NYugi's life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Off to a bad start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.57,0:02:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.65,0:02:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi just lost almost\Nhalf his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.31,0:02:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a break for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he certainly is a talented lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only does he have impressive skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.99,0:02:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,he also has a great deal of\Nrespect for the cards in his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we both know, that is\Nthe mark of a true duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure when push comes to shove,\NLeon's gonna do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.97,0:02:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Schroeder-Kaiba\Nrivalry is a bitter one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and the anger and jealousy between\Nthe two families runs deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd better not let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:03:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon I'm impressed My deck of fairy tale
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,cards has always come\Nthrough for me In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a time when these\Ncards seemed like my only friends
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it started when\NI began reading folk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,tales and fables to pass\Nthe time It sounds weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but I used to pretend that I was a part of\Nthe stories The characters were so cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and the adventures they\Nwent on were awesome,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.35,0:03:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and I wasn't the only one who thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian Pegasus felt the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so he created a whole series of duel\Nmonster cards inspired by these fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's when my passion\Nfor dueling first started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And ever since then, I dreamed\Nabout being a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't about my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about finally paying my\Ndues to the Schroeder family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,by making sure Kaivah\NCorp falls into ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.81,0:03:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to get through to you is\Nto duel you with all of my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll begin by playing my\NQueen's Knight in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack his forest hunter\Nwith Majestic Sword Swipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place one card face\Ndown, and that ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd say that. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the special\Nability of my iron cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm able to bring an old\Nfriend back to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, now that Hans\Nis back in the action,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,my iron knight strength drops back to 700.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't worry me one bit,\Nbecause Iron Hans also lets me play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Another Iron Knight
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And next I'll activate my\NSpinning Wheel Spindle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What can he possibly do to Yugi\Nwith the giant roll of string?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:05:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know that card. I saw it in\NLeon's deck when I dueled against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster destruction\Ncard. Time to reenact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the story of Sleeping\NBeauty with your queen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done? She's had a long\Nday, so now your queen's night's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna take a little snooze in the\Ngraveyard don't worry she'll be back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,in three turns of course by then i'll\Nhave already won your championship
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,title and now that you're\Ndefenseless i'll attack you directly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,reveal face down card mirror force
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.83,0:05:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack is reflected back to your\Nside, destroying all of your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who's defenseless now? Nice one, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, tough break, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Schroders have a\Nhabit of toying with our
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,opponents just before\Ndestroying our opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.83,0:06:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time to\Nreveal the final secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.03,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on. I activate a magic\Ncard known as Water of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's overflowing with power,\Nincluding the ability to bring
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,back monsters from beyond the\Ngrave And I choose Iron Hans
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And he lets me play this, my\NIron Knight in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That knight keeps coming back for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the deck that won't quit Yup,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's why Leon's so hard to defeat He
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,built his deck with the\Nperfect balance of magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,trap and monster cards\NWell I just hope Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.05,0:06:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,can find a weakness before\Nit's too late Me too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you've got. Very\Nwell, I'll start with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.47,0:07:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card, Pot of Greed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to draw two\Nmore cards from my deck
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, unfortunately for you, I\Ndrew this. Your Wadda Pond? Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and since I moved it from\Nmy deck to my hand using a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic card, I can summon my\NWadda Pond directly to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I sacrifice my Waterpond in\Norder to summon my Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's one of your most famous monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not cool, because\Nnow I have to destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:08:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if she destroys you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Dark Magician Girl, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say it was nice meeting\Nyour Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.95,0:08:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But as the saying goes, all\Ngood things must come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And your end is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've toyed with these\Nfools for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.19,0:08:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to unleash\Nthe final phase of our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to, Siegfried?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same card you drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Some might call that a\Ncoincidence, but I call it fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to Pot of Greed,\NI can draw two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your family proud, Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.91,0:09:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ut activates that card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely day for a duel, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you brought everything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It might bring you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even heard of this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's probably because\Nit's one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been saving it just for you, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,When you draw this card, I want\Nyou to play it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that and the entire Schroeder family\Nwill have you to thank. Really? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't let\Nyou down, down, down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything we've done so far has\Nbeen leading up to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.47,0:10:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do this for our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.57,0:10:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Put his father before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.49,0:10:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Make Schroeder a household name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Golden Castle of Stromberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone know what that is? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, how did you\Nget your hands on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard stories about that card,\Nbut I thought it was never released.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.03,0:11:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Huh? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting some interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, the mainframe's running fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Signal strength looks fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, whatever it was, it's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.59,0:11:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the special effect\Nof my golden castle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me summon any monster to\Nthe field with four stars or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.27,0:11:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So I play Cinderella in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And where would she be\Nwithout her pumpkin carriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And her glass slipper?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.05,0:11:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.99,0:11:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That princess is tougher than she looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I mention whenever Pumpkin\NCarriage is on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinderella's allowed to go\Nstraight for your life points?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Cinderella, attack him directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,After Cinderella attacks, she transfers\Nher glass slippers to one of your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But that footwear doesn't come cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got to cough up 1,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's getting crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the king of games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he's scared of some princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a monster in heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, where did he get that card?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And what card would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the mood for games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.41,0:12:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what are you two whispering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's that castle, isn't it? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, kids, there are several Duel\NMonsters cards that Pegasus created,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but never fully developed, and\Ntherefore never officially released.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Golden Castle of\NStromberg is one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:13:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how did Leon get hold of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.79,0:13:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I recall a tournament\Nseveral years ago that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,offered the Golden Castle\Ncard as the grand prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was never meant\Nto be used. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it was only a test sample, it\Nwas forbidden from tournament play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And since only one copy was ever made,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it remains one of the most\Nsought-after cards in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't believe that\NLeon has it in his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, you realize your brother\Njust played an illegal card, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.63,0:13:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg to differ, Herr Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's really a non-registered card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon's dual disc shouldn't\Nhave recognized it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The card limiter must\Nhave been deactivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means that Leon is cheating. I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the real reason you hacked\Ninto my computer system, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.35,0:13:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of games is about to\Nbe dethroned by a Schroeder,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.31,0:13:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,so you accuse me of cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon simply played a strong card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me, cause your cheap\Ncomputer network decided to malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame your poor excuse for a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Kaiba Corp's heyday is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, no one's gonna buy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fact, Leon broke the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He played a non-registered\Ncard in an official duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.45,0:14:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then why don't you just go\Nright ahead and cancel the match?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you promised\Nthe world a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, this duel will go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.27,0:14:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber knows if he disqualifies Leon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,his entire tournament was pointless,\Nand his reputation will plummet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really a forbidden card?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother would never\Nlie to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon, just continue your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Golden Castle of Stromberg\Nwas accepted by your dual disc,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.97,0:14:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,so it can't be illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:15:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show these people what\Nit means to be a Schroeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. How could you? I knew you were
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,a jerk but lying to your own brother
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,poor guy don't listen to them Leon they
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.05,0:15:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,don't care about you these friends of her
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,kyber just want to tear our family apart\Nnow who are you going to believe these
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Strangers or your own flesh and blood?\NIt's just I don't want to win by cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that card is legal. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,trust him why not he's just using you he
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,reprogrammed kyber corpse dueling system\Nforcing our dual discs to accept an
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.27,0:15:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,illegal card is this true well it looks\Nlike i've been figured out but it's too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,late to stop me now the most powerful card\Nnever released is already on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and no one can stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one true victor\Nhere, and that's Schroeder Corp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,For when my brother Leon\Nis crowned world champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.35,0:16:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,will be the number one\Ngaming company on Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.95,0:16:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if you force him to win by cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You say cheating, I say creative dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.57,0:16:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, I was supposed\Nto win fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.53,0:16:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the plan, don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out the rules\Ndidn't fit my needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now use the card I gave you\Nand let me handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All your dreams are about to be realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them pass you by.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, my dream has always\Nbeen to win in a duel against Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.99,0:16:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I refuse to do it\Nby breaking the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate Mystical Space Typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll use it to destroy my\Ngolden castle of Stromberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need that hunk\Nof junk weighing you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially a hunk of junk that's illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling I couldn't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.17,0:17:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I've taken matters\Ninto my own hands. You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,since the castle of\NStromberghard was never finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to add a few twists of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But a duelist can't change\Nthe attributes of a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless he's able to rewrite\Nthe file and alter the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done? Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Witness, if you will, the\Nfinal phase of my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.49,0:17:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with the reception?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Spill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you think I hacked into your\Ndueling program just to strengthen one card,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,then you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, that card was nothing\Nmore than a key, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as it was played,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it unlocked the most devastating\Nvirus ever constructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch the antiviral program\Nimmediately. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Too little, too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of Kyber Corp's program files and\Ndatabanks are being deleted as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And when your empire crumbles,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian Pegasus will have no choice\Nbut to negotiate a partnership with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.83,0:18:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You snake! All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have trusted\Nhim, and now it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted the chance\Nto face you in a fair duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But that chance is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know me better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My virus can't be stopped by surrendering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't? Come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.35,0:18:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way you\Ncan put an end to all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy the golden castle of\NStromberg and the virus will cease.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic and trap cards are\Nuseless against it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and who knows what other\Nabilities Siegfried added to that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We continue the duel, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother made that card indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened to the leon\Ni met when this tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,first began he wouldn't\Nbe giving up he'd be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,fighting for his dream\Nnow duel against me with
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,everything you have and show\Nsiegfried what the heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,of the cards is all about\Nand together you and i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,will put an end to your\Nbrother's selfish scheme
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,are you sure just trust\Nme every card has its
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,weakness we just need We\Nneed to figure out this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and we don't have much time.
